<title>MOROCCO: Morocco to become training centre for fishing.</title>
<headline>Morocco to become training centre for fishing.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco and Canada have signed an accord to set up a regional training centre for fishery development in the North African country, the Moroccan fisheries ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The centre will train staff from francophone countries on techniques to preserve fish stocks and on quality control, promotion of products and security at sea.</p>
<p>The centre will be located in the southern port city of Agadir, it said.</p>
</text>
